        description: "The [[ship:automaton_keeper]] is a ring of four shielded pods round a heart: open the pods one by one, or break their bridges and fight each on its own; the heart's beams hold until its cores go dark. Beaten, its gate opens.",
        lore: "Its pods turn to the gate before they turn to you.",
        tags: ["boss"],
        ships: [
            (ship: "automaton_keeper", count: (1, 1)),
            (ship: "automaton_hunter", count: (3, 3)),
