        summary: "A gate close to the core, the long crystal-warded guardian that keeps it, and two lancers and two hunters at its side.",
        description: "The [[ship:automaton_spire]]'s [[part:prism_ward|prism wards]] turn laser fire, so cannons and missiles do the work here. Its torpedoes reach far; break its bridges and the head and body are left without a drive while the tail flies on. Beaten, its gate opens.",
